Calendar: conversion between the Julian Day Count and the Gregorian,
Julian, Jewish and French Republican calendars, and the date of Easter.

The module calendar of PHP 7.4 for php74 of azsupport/ports, which
installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20190902/calendar.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php74/conf.d,
its headers in include/php74/php/ext/calendar.
